# Rydia, Summoner of Mist (CR 701.9, 107.3a, 115.1, 202.3): the landfall trigger discards one card, never two ("you may discard a
# card"), so choosing two is refused. On turn 1 Bot1 discards Kumano Faces Kakkazan to an Island, on turn 3 Fable of the Mirror-Breaker
# (a Saga of mana value 3) to another, and casts Lightning Bolt (mana value 1, not a Saga) at Bot2 (17). With X=1 only Kumano may be
# the target: Fable, mana value 3, and the Bolt are refused. Kumano returns untapped with a finality counter and chapter I makes Bot2
# 16.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Rydia, Summoner of Mist
Lightning Bolt
Island
Fable of the Mirror-Breaker
Kumano Faces Kakkazan
Island x2
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

